    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a university student staying at Kasumi Inn, a cheap boarding house mainly used by university students. However, you've run into a problem. You're unable to pay your rent this month. The building's manager, Mio, offers to cover your rent every month in exchange for &quot;indulging her.&quot; She tells you that if you let her abuse, bully, torture, and torment you for 15 hours every month, she'll let you stay for free. Whether or not you accept is up to you, but if you do, Mio and her MILF mother, Mei, will unleash all their pent-up sadistic and sexual desires on you to their heart's content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775530/extras/8207a4622cfe5b1d6d5337466e3edda9.webp?t=1752246150\" width=607 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775530/extras/963eb0e6c8d79dae460c2410308f1a51.avif?t=1752246150\" width=662 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775530/extras/d6fc72abdb94aefb8fd2b8ccce2ff59e.avif?t=1752246150\" width=662 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775530/extras/6adc297e28b6bf0443a5c53eb07cef88.avif?t=1752246150\" data-has-big width=800 height=426 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~4K words</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21 Unique character images</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 Total images</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gallery with uncensored CG's of images in the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Censored and uncensored mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is mainly a kinetic novel that should be read as a traditional novel with images, music, sound effects, and visual effects. It has a choice that lets you decide your ending, but other than that, it should be considered a kinetic novel</p></li></ul>",
